{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53633","headline":"在唐日赠剑南僧惟上离合诗 · 空海","name":"在唐日赠剑南僧惟上离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"磴危人难行，石嶮兽无登。\n烛暗迷前後，蜀人不得登。\n（同前）（按：张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入後三首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"空海","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}